$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (pentylcarbamoyl)(thiophen-2-yl)methyl benzoate (31)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 15 (44 mg, 57 μL,
0.45 mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (58 mg, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv)
and aldehyde 12 (53 mg, 43 μL, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv) in CH2Cl2 was
stirred for 48 hrs. After removal of solvent and silica gel
chromatography, 31 (112 mg, 75%) was obtained as a whitish-brown solid.
Data for 31: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.14-8.08 (m, 2H, aryl);
7.64-7.60 (m, 1H, aryl); 7.48 (t, J= 8.0 Hz, 2H, aryl); 7.34 (dd, J= 1.2,
4.8 Hz, 1H, aryl); 7.26 (m, 1H, aryl); 7.00 (dd, J= 3.6, 4.8 Hz, 1H,
aryl); 6.60 (s, 1H, CH); 6.21 (bt, 1H, NH); 3.40-3.26 (sept, J= 7.2 Hz,
2H, CH2); 1.57-1.50 (quin, J= 6.8 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.36-1.23 (m, 4H, CH2);
0.85 (t, J= 7.2 Hz, 3H, CH3) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.6, 165.1,
137.7, 134.0, 130.4, 130.2, 129.5, 128.9, 128.3, 127.1, 71.9, 39.8, 29.3,
29.1, 22.5, 14.2 IR: (neat) νmax = 3304, 3072, 2957, 2931, 2860, 1724,
1691, 1451, 1264, 708 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.42 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) LRMS: EIMS
calculated for C18H21NO3S+ [M+ H]+: 332.1, found: 332.0 HPLC: (+/−)-31 tR
16.2 min (48.0%); tR 19.0 min (52.0 %) (−)-31 tR 17.3 min (20.0%); tR
22.4 min (80.0%) (Diacel Chiralpak AS-H 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm, 10% IPA in
Hexane, 1 mL/min; isocratic) OR: [α]D22 = -2.5° (CHCl3, c = 1.41)
