$DATUM To explore the stereoselectivity of the related Passerini reaction, γ
-ketoacid 7 was reacted with indole-isonitrile 1 to yield 11 in 74% yield
as a 5.5:1 anti-syn mixture (Scheme 6).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, anti:syn 5.5:1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of bicyclic pyroglutamic acid featuring the Ugi reaction and a
unique stereoisomerization at the angular position by Grob fragmentation
followed by a transannular ketene [2+2] cycloaddition reaction
