$DATUM Oaksmith, Jennifer M.; Peters, Ulf; Ganem, Bruce
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2004), 126(42), 13606-13607

