$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Depsipeptide 19c. According to General Procedure II, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 18 (100 mg, 0.18 mmol), paraformaldehyde (8 mg, 0.27
mmol) and ZGly-OH (41 mg, 0.20 mmol) afforded after 48 h 19c (103 mg,
0.13 mmol 72%) as a white foam. Column chromatography was performed with
c-hexane/EtOAc 6:4. 19c, yield (103 mg, 0.13 mmol 72%) 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3): δ (ppm) 7.73 (s, 1H), 7.68-7.64 (m, 2H), 7.45-7.15 (m, 21H),
7.02-7.00 (m, 2H), 6.12 (bs, 1H), 5.67 (d, J= 7.0 Hz, 1H), 5.33 (bs, 1H),
5.23 (d, J= 7.0 Hz, 1H), 5.16 (s, 2H), 5.11 (s, 2H), 4.32 (s, 2H),
4.09-3.88 (m, 6H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3): δ (ppm) 170.3 (C), 169.2
(C), 168.7 (C), 167.2 (C), 164.9 (C), 156.2 (C), 140.5 (C), 138.0 (C),
136.3 (C), 136.2 (C), 135.1 (C), 134.2 (C), 129.0 (CH), 128.8 (2 CH),
128.7 (2 CH), 128.6 (4 CH), 128.5 (3 CH), 128.4 (CH), 128.3 (2 CH), 128.1
(CH), 128.0 (4 CH), 127.8 (3 CH), 127.2 (2 CH), 112.4 (CH), 67.2 (CH2),
67.1 (CH2), 64.0 (C), 63.2 (CH), 48.2 (CH2), 42.4 (CH2), 42.0 (CH), 41.1
(CH2); IR (neat): 3345 (w), 3065 (w), 2943 (w), 1724 (m), 1663 (s), 1506
(m), 1497 (m), 1343 (w), 1244 (w), 1171 (s), 1053 (w), 1030 (w), 1001
(w), 959 9w), 758 (m), 739 (m), 696 (s), 590 (w); HRMS (FAB): calculated
for C46H43N4O9 (MH+) 795.3025, found 795.3025.
