$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Use of β-amino acids in the Ugi reaction
(Scheme 2) produces βA library of 32 β-lactams was created by Ugi
reaction in water using building blocks 2, 3, and 5 and isolated by
extraction. The HPLC purity of the crude reaction products was 70-99% (av
89%), and the yields of these products were 71-89% (av 84%). These
results are summarized in Table S3. yield 71%
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM combinatorial
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Multicomponent Reactions Are Accelerated in Water
